  - name: "S.D.C. Mortal"
    description: "No natural A.R. and no M.D.C. - an Elf needs M.D.C. body armor, a force field or magic. Most prefer light to medium armor, from magical and homespun to full environmental and power armor. No Horror Factor."
  - name: "Magic P.P.E."
    description: "An Elf who becomes a practitioner of magic adds the racial 5D6 P.P.E. to the O.C.C.''s P.P.E. base."
restrictions:
