extraction_notes: |
  - Rifts Conversion Book One printed 86-87 (file p087-p088). The Rifts conversion of the Palladium Fantasy Elf, which is the `elf` row. A separate class because a variant cannot cross systems; not a `copy_of`, because the Rifts page adds skills, bonuses and a restriction the Palladium row does not have.
  - Attribute dice, hit points, P.P.E. 5D6 and the S.D.C. of 10 match the Palladium row. "10, plus those gained from O.C.C.s and physical skills" is a POOL BONUS.
  - "Special Skills of Note" gives Elven/Dragonese spoken and read at 98%, one other literacy (+20%) and Basic Math (+20%) to 90% of Elves. Granted, with that on each line. The other literacy is a choice among the catalog''s literacy rows.
